This license covers the original source code in this repository only. It does
NOT extend to:

- The **DHET coat of arms** and **Khetha wordmark**, which are inlined as brand
  assets for demonstration purposes. Use of the South African national coat of
  arms by third parties is subject to separate rules under the Department of
  Higher Education and Training — confirm permission with DHET before any
  public or production deployment. See `README.md` → Known limitations.
- Content sourced or adapted from the **National Career Advice Portal (NCAP)**,
  which remains the property of DHET's Khetha Career Development Services.
- Any occupation, qualification, provider, event or salary data marked as
  illustrative in this repository, which is provided for demonstration only
  and is not authoritative careers information.
